
@startuml DeploymentDiagram
!theme plain
top to bottom direction

title Sơ đồ triển khai hạ tầng BrewLite (AWS & Docker)

node "Client Device" {
  [Browser / Mobile App (PWA)] as ClientApp
}

node "GitHub Services" as GitHubCloud {
  [GitHub Repository (Monorepo)] as Repo
  [GitHub Actions (CI/CD Pipeline)] as Pipeline
}

node "AWS Cloud (ap-southeast-1)" {

  node "EC2 Instance (Ubuntu 26.04.1 LTS)" as EC2 {
    [Nginx Reverse Proxy + Let's Encrypt SSL\n(47.129.180.144.sslip.io - Port 80/443)] as Nginx

    folder "Docker Engine" {
      node "Container: apps/web" as WebContainer {
        [Next.js PWA (Port 3000)] as NextServer
      }

      node "Container: apps/api" as ApiContainer {
        [NestJS API Server (Port 3001)] as NestApi
      }
    }

    [EC2 Security Group\nInbound: Port 80, 443 (0.0.0.0/0)\nChặn public Port 3000 & 3001] as EC2SecGroup
  }

  node "Amazon RDS Service (Private Subnet)" as RDSNode {
    database "PostgreSQL Instance (Port 5432)" as DBInstance {
      [brewlite-db (Persistent Storage)] as PostgresDB
    }
    [RDS Security Group\nInbound: Port 5432 (Chỉ từ EC2 SG)] as RDSSecGroup
  }
}

ClientApp --> Nginx : HTTPS (Port 443)\n(HTTP 80 tự động redirect -> 443)
Nginx --> NextServer : Proxy "/" -> localhost:3000
Nginx --> NestApi : Proxy "/api/*" -> localhost:3001
NestApi --> PostgresDB : DATABASE_URL (Port 5432 nội bộ)

Pipeline --> Repo : Trigger on PR / Push to main
Pipeline ..> WebContainer : Build & Test Check
Pipeline ..> ApiContainer : Build & Test Check
Pipeline ..> EC2 : SSH Deploy & Smoke Test / Rollback

note right of EC2SecGroup
  Chỉ mở công khai HTTP (80) & HTTPS (443) qua Nginx.
  Container 3000 và 3001 chỉ lắng nghe nội bộ (localhost).
end note

note right of PostgresDB
  Lưu trữ dữ liệu bền vững (Persistent).
  Public Access: No (Tắt truy cập công khai,
  chỉ nhận kết nối từ EC2 Security Group).
end note

@enduml
